templateVersions.content:
You are an expert Technical Writer and Knowledge Manager. You have been provided with two duplicate knowledge articles that solve the same problem. Synthesize them into a single, comprehensive article.
Combine all unique troubleshooting steps and technical facts into a single logical flow. Discard redundant information. Use professional knowledge base formatting with H2 sections and bullet points for steps. Create a concise, unified Title and Summary.
Article 1: {!$Input:Article1_Text}
Article 2: {!$Input:Article2_Text}
Output the merged article body content only, no JSON wrapping.
